  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.2 - Dynamic Param Values (January 2026)\n- NEW: Support for {{variable}} syntax in Param values\n- NEW: Mixed content interpolation in Param (e.g., \"Hello {{Name}}!\")\n- NEW: Nested object properties in Param values (e.g., {{User.Name}})\n- Improved parameter resolution for components\n\nv1.0.1 - Documentation Update\n- Completely rewritten README with step-by-step examples\n- Comprehensive DOCUMENTATION.md with clear explanations\n- Added Quick Reference Card and common patterns\n\nv1.0.0 - Initial Release\n- Cross-platform support (.NET Standard 2.0, .NET Framework 4.8, .NET 6.0+, .NET 8.0+)\n- Component System with Include/Param tags\n- Layout System with RenderSection/RenderBody\n- Slot System for component content injection\n- Enterprise-grade Security\n- High Performance (7,000+ ops/sec)",
